# B23: alternative branches with ||.
# untranslated: E_UNCORRECTABLE: ls /srv/app/out || mkdir /srv/app/out
#   problem: `||` has no translation: a program has no alternative branch; check the condition with `assert` and run the alternative as a separate step (alternative_branch)
#   fix: list "/srv/app/out" hidden: false
